Root cause:
The bug was caused by the `move_focus()` function incorrectly setting focus to an output instead of the workspace associated with that output. This behavior prevented users from switching between outputs effectively, particularly when a workspace with children was selected. The patch corrects this by ensuring that when an output is focused, the focus is instead set to the corresponding workspace.
